      "title": "CNSSI 1253 Attachment 2 \u2014 Space Platform Overlay (Aug 2025; CNSS HHH baseline tailored)",
      "version": "2022-2025",
      "oscal-version": "1.1.2",
      "last-modified": "2026-05-01T01:07:42+00:00",
      "remarks": "Effective control baseline for a space NSS, derived by applying the Space Platform Overlay (August 2025) tailoring to the CNSSI 1253 High/High/High baseline: union of CNSS HHH plus controls the overlay adds, minus controls the overlay justifies as Not Selected (typically due to space-environment assumptions like NOT GENERAL PURPOSE or hard-radiation-only environments)."
